  "historical_output_text": " Subject: A Nice Surprise\n\nHey there,\n\nJust wanted to take a minute to let you know about something I noticed today. There's a little orange and black butterfly that's been fluttering around the garden. It's so pretty and has been a real treat to watch. I thought of you because you love butterflies, and I'm sure you would have loved to see it too.\n\nIf you're free tomorrow afternoon, maybe we could go check it out together? It would be a lovely way to spend some time and enjoy nature, plus it would be a great chance to catch up.\n\nHope you're well, and looking forward to your reply.\n\nBest,\n[Your Name] P.S. If you're interested, I have some butterfly feeders at home, so we could set one up and maybe even attract more. Wouldn't that be fun? 🦋✨\n\n",
